OL,3,GNEWSATrain services resume after major
OL,4,Adisruption but delays continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have begun running again
OL,7,Fthrough Stockport after damage to
OL,8,Foverhead electrical wires caused major
OL,9,Fdisruption across the rail network.
OL,11,FAn empty Northern train became stranded
OL,12,Fnear Stockport Viaduct shortly after
OL,13,Fmidnight on Friday, blocking the line
OL,14,Fand forcing the closure of all railway
OL,15,Flines through the station.
OL,17,FSix train operators were affected,
OL,18,Fincluding Avanti West Coast, Northern
OL,19,Fand CrossCountry, with services
OL,20,Fcancelled, diverted or terminating
OL,21,Fearlier than scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
