OL,3,GNEWSATrain services resume after major
OL,4,Adisruption but delays continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FShortly after 09:30 BST, Network Rail
OL,7,Fsaid engineers had repaired the damage
OL,8,Fand reopened the lines, but warned
OL,9,Fpassengers to expect further delays and
OL,10,Fcancellations while services returned
OL,11,Fto normal.
